 "name": "POLSCA Baltic Ferries' (Polferries, Unity Line) ferries Świnoujście–Ystad, Świnoujście–Trelleborg, Gdańsk–Nynäshamn and Gdańsk–Karlshamn, trucks",
 "law": "POLSCA Baltic Ferries' (Polferries and Unity Line) freight tariff valid from 2026-06-22, one way, EUR net, the same both ways: Świnoujście–Ystad and Świnoujście–Trelleborg: trucks up to 7 m EUR 125 and over 7 to 9 m EUR 150 per unit, heavy goods vehicles over 9 m EUR 25 per commenced metre; Gdańsk–Nynäshamn: trucks up to 7 m EUR 250 and over 7 to 9 m EUR 300 per unit, heavy goods vehicles over 9 m EUR 39 per commenced metre; Gdańsk–Karlshamn: trucks up to 7 m EUR 150 and over 7 to 9 m EUR 180 per unit, heavy goods vehicles over 9 m EUR 30 per commenced metre, including one driver, a cabin place and two meals; by the truck's length in whole metres up. With the bunker-environmental surcharge (BES) per commenced metre: Świnoujście–Ystad and Świnoujście–Trelleborg EUR 12.51 (from 2026-10-01), Gdańsk–Nynäshamn EUR 24.81 (from 2026-10-01), Gdańsk–Karlshamn EUR 15.74 (from 2026-10-01). The ETS surcharge isn't added: carbon-cost prices the EU ETS on a crossing from the ships' MRV data. The weight and width surcharges (general cargo, over-standard vehicles) aren't applied. TT-Line sails Świnoujście–Trelleborg too; its freight rates aren't published, so that crossing is priced at POLSCA's. Ports at OpenStreetMap's ferry terminals, priced where the line goes out on its car ferry line.",
 "sources": [
